## Acceptance boundary

This closes Java-style queued-future return and pending-state semantics for jobs represented in the Rust client and pull scheduler queues. The 30 Java statistics maintenance entries remain a known P18-V01 delta, and broad source/API/settings/input/error/control-flow/reverse-export reconciliation remains PARTIAL. Current-revision remote CI, native Windows runtime evidence, and Phase 19 live Broker/Docker validation remain separate. No plan was edited, no push or remote CI was run, and the four user-owned Phase 19 worktree paths remain untouched and unstaged.
